# TDK Guncel Turkce Sozluk (sozluk.gov.tr): "yuzyil" = "yuz yillik zaman
# parcasi" (a hundred-year span). "asir" (Arabic loan, also TDK-listed as
# a century synonym) is deliberately left out -- one attested surface is
# enough and keeping the set small keeps the false-positive risk down.
yüzyıl
yüzyıllar
